# Build a Project from Scratch | TanStack Start React Docs
created: undefined, last updated: 2026-07-17, [Read more](https://tanstack.com/start/latest/docs/framework/react/build-from-scratch)

Install the build tool and React integration you want to use:
...
npm i -D vite @vitejs/plugin-react
...
Then configure TanStack Start's build tool plugin:
vite.config.ts
```
import { defineConfig } from 'vite'
import { tanstackStart } from '@tanstack/react-start/plugin/vite'
import viteReact from '@vitejs/plugin-react'
export default defineConfig({
server: {
port: 3000,
},
resolve: {
tsconfigPaths: true,
},
plugins: [
tanstackStart(),
// react's vite plugin must come after start's vite plugin
viteReact(),
],
})
```
```
